    "body": "Sorry @ahmetv10: the review mistook this for one of our own PRs and turned it back to draft. Fork PRs are left as their contributor set them, so it's marked ready again. The review above stands: the change is sound (`operations` is now selected for motion generator changes, no suite dropped, xtask green, clippy clean), but please bump `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION`, since `xtask/src/tests.rs` is a process file. Push when you can, and it gets a delta review. (M5)",
