    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: b0e206f2ad020b2323fae9059922b50a02a81820 -->\n**Delta review (M5, since 02c79889): ready for the maintainer to merge.**\n\nThe new head b0e206f2 is the reviewed change rebased onto current main. Its `crates/` and `xtask/` hunks are line-for-line identical to the reviewed head, and the one requested change is now there: `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION` 16 → 17. Main is at 16. Other open process PRs also claim 17 and up, so whichever merges later renumbers, and the merging session posts the number that lands on #681. The verdict from the full review (operations is now selected for motion-generator changes, no suite dropped, xtask green, clippy clean) stands. Thanks @ahmetv10.",
