    "body": "Conflict resolved as asked: merged NeoTech/Camcraft main (37482923) into the branch, commit 6af3a4ca, pushed.\n\n- crates/app/tests/operations.rs: kept main's crate-qualified Gate map and re-applied only the gate-plan change - it now adds motion::machining3d, motion::multiaxis and motion::plunge_law (drilling/finishing3d/machining2d were already named after the split).\n- .claude/PROCESS_VERSION: main is 30, so this takes 31.\n- The pin moved into xtask/src/gate_maps_tests.rs (the real-checkout selection suite from #922): it checks the map names all six generators and that a crates/motion/src/multiaxis/ change selects app:operations. xtask/src/tests.rs is back to main's version.\n\nOn the merged tree: cargo test -p xtask 56 passed, cargo xtask gate quick --base origin/main ok (app operations 62 s, xtask 2 s), clippy -p xtask -p camcraft-app --all-targets -D warnings clean. Net diff against main is 3 files, +15/-2. Ready again.",
